  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project comprises the establishment of and support to a womens resource center in the Samttskhe-Javakheti region. The development objective is to reduce the conflict potential through promoting local governance, poverty alleviation and the active participation of rural women in social, political and economic life. Project objective is to establisg the center as part of a larger UNDP programme.</narrative>
